 adventures.","releaseInfo":"2017","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvV29ya2Fob2xpY3MtJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMTEtMjAxNyUyOS03MjBwLw","type":"series","name":"Workaholics 720p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2017","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvWW91bmctU2hlbGRvbi0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxNy0lMjktNzIwcC8","type":"series","name":"Young Sheldon 720p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2017","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvWi1UaGUtQmVnaW5uaW5nLW9mLUV2ZXJ5dGhpbmctJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMTUtMjAxNyUyOS8","type":"series","name":"Z The Beginning of Everything","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2017","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvQmFyYmFyaWFucyUyMFJpc2luZyUyMCUyODIwMTYlMjkv","type":"series","name":"Barbarians Rising","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/9a6y8UZJ3jGcLLpJsOrDFZcSfO.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oJbR8aFO7rCLdGOu2HcUxeOSbnn.jpg","description":"Told from the perspective of the rebel leaders, the series chronicles a wave of rebellions against absolute power by those the Roman Empire called “barbarians” – tribes they viewed as beyond the fringe of civilization that lived a brutish and violent existence. But these also were men and women who launched epic struggles that shaped the world to come with a centuries-long fight to defeat the sprawling empire.","releaseInfo":"2016","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvQmlsbGlvbnMlMjAlMjgyMDE2JTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"Billions","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/edwYPQdZE998d748AdwWLsfy0rl.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/51Hw58fMwJQKYJ6XYJIRQBP9EPA.jpg","description":"Shr